---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Holiday Gift Hub"
  description="Privacy Policy and cookie notice for Holiday Gift Hub. We respect your privacy and protect personal data."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: October 22, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to Holiday Gift Hub ("we", "our", or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal data collected when you visit our website. This privacy policy explains how we handle visitor data in compliance with international standards including GDPR and CCPA.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not require users to create accounts. We may collect anonymous analytical data including browser type, operating system, pages viewed, time spent on pages, and referral sources via Google Analytics 4 to improve content quality.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          We use essential cookies to ensure site functionality and anonymous analytical cookies to measure site traffic. When you click outbound affiliate links to Amazon or other partner networks, a 24-hour tracking cookie is set by Amazon to attribute qualifying purchases.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Third-Party Links and Affiliates</h2>
        <p>
          Our site contains affiliate links to third-party e-commerce platforms (such as Amazon.com and Amazon.co.uk). Once you leave our domain, your browsing is governed by the privacy practices of that third-party merchant.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data rights, please contact us at: <code>contact@holidaygifthub.com</code> (or via our <a href="/contact" class="text-red-700 underline font-semibold">Contact Page</a>).
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
